categories and ask for help in #development. If you can't identify a merge request, ask for help in #development.
Flaky test or regression? A flaky test sometimes passes and sometimes fails without any code change: it passes when you retry the CI job or can't be reproduced locally. A regression always fails after a specific merge request, even on retry, and you can reproduce it locally on the default branch. CI Health incidents usually come from regressions. If you think the failure is flaky, search test failure issues by spec path for an existing issue and add a comment linking this incident.

